<title>SPAIN: POLL-Bankinter H1 net attributable seen up 7.5 pct.</title>
<headline>POLL-Bankinter H1 net attributable seen up 7.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forecasts for first-half results for Spain's Bankinter group. Numbers in billions of pesetas.</p>
<p>				   H1 97	  H1 96	 RANGE</p>
<p>    Net interest income    18.83	  18.60    18.50-19.24</p>
<p>    Operating income	 19.35	  16.60    17.29-22.47</p>
<p>    Net attributable	  9.53	   8.87     9.35-9.60</p>
<p>NOTE - The group will release results mid-month.</p>
<p>Contributors: BBV Interactivos, Benito y Monjardin, Inverban, AB Asesores, Ahorro Corp, Beta Capital.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +3 41 585 2167</p>
</text>
